            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%A9tale+Lie+groupoids"} étale Lie groupoids
            that all describe the spindle orbifold. We describe a couple of useful models.
          %h4#AsProperEtaleGroupoidMinimal Minimal model
          %p
