                Francisco C. Caramello Jr, Ex. 1.3.1 in:
                %em Introduction to orbifolds
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.08699"}> arXiv:1909.08699
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p The above text and graphics follow:
          %ul
            %li#SS26
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
